Package: dmlfamily
Type: Package
Title: Double Machine Learning Family for jamovi
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Mingchao Sun
Maintainer: Mingchao Sun <mingchao.sun@hotmail.com>
URL: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/dmlfamily
BugReports: https://github.com/mingchao-sun/dmlfamily/issues
Description: Double/debiased machine learning with cross-fitting for jamovi: partially
    linear regression, the interactive regression model for a binary treatment (ATE and
    ATT) and partially linear instrumental variables, with linear, lasso, ridge, elastic
    net and random forest learners (Chernozhukov et al., 2018).
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports:
    jmvcore (>= 2.3.4),
    R6,
    ggplot2,
    glmnet,
    ranger
